{"id":"01039","root":"uni01039_1","name":{"ja":"ドニ・ボーガン","en":"Doni Bogan"},"title":{"ja":"【監獄戦艦x対魔忍】","en":"【Prison Battleship x Taimanin】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【監獄戦艦x対魔忍】 ドニ・ボーガン","en":"【Prison Battleship x Taimanin】 Doni Bogan"},"aliases":["Donny Bohgan"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","Prison Battleship"],"release":"2026-04-15","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"宇宙連邦軍の少佐であり、要人輸送用の戦艦ジャサント号の艦長。 \nしかし裏の顔は、ネオ・テラーズに属する特殊工作員で、暗殺や破壊活動といった任務を遂行する非合法エージェント。 \n自らの栄達には興味があっても、政治的な執着心はまったくないが、ニュー・ソラル派のいう偽善に聞こえる主張・言動よりは、現実的で人間らしいネオ・テラーズの程よい腐敗具合に愛着がある。 \n彼の関心は、洗脳装置＜メモリープラント＞による人間洗脳の技術にあり、それが自身の栄達に役立つのではないかと考えている。 \nまた趣向として、まったく新しい人格を人工的に作ってしまうという神をも恐れぬ所業に陶酔している節もある。 \n過去、リエリとナオミが関係する任務の失敗で投獄された経験があり、出所後は顔を変えて二人への復讐の一念で出世をはかってきた。","en":"He is a major in the Space Federation Army and captain of the personnel-transport battleship Jasant. However, his secret identity is a covert operative for Neo-Terrors, carrying out illegal missions such as assassination and sabotage. Though he cares about his own advancement, he has no political obsession; he prefers the realistic, human-like corruption of Neo-Terrors over the hypocritical rhetoric of the New Soul faction. His interest lies in the Memory Plant brain-washing technology, believing it could further his rise. He is also fascinated by the god-defying act of artificially creating entirely new personalities. In the past he was imprisoned after a failed mission involving Lieri and Naomi, and after his release he changed his appearance and has been climbing the ranks driven by a single purpose: revenge against them."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで(原案：カガミ)","voiceActor":"金田真男","forms":[{"id":"uni01039_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1090,2180],"sp":[180,180],"atk":[182,364],"def":[135,270],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","2530335"],"evolve":[["evo00004",5],["evo00005",15],["evo00006",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni01039_2",